jobResponsibilities:
You will be expected to:
·	assist in the digitisation and management of court records to facilitate searches and retrieval of records to improve operational efficiency;
·	co-ordinate efforts of the different sections and provide assistance to facilitate seamless delivery of quality service to court users;
·	collaborate with case management officers and other sections to enhance customer satisfaction and the quality of service delivery;
